  user_input {
    user_response: "# PROJECT: OUR FIRST CHAPTER \342\235\244\357\270\217\n## Premium Interactive 1st Anniversary Website\n\nAct as a senior frontend engineer, creative director, UI/UX designer, and motion designer.\n\nI am providing you with a ZIP file containing one of my previously developed React birthday storytelling websites. Your task is to transform it into a completely new, premium, romantic **1st Relationship Anniversary Experience** dedicated to a girl named Rabeya.\n\nThis is not a simple greeting website. It should feel like an interactive digital love story.\n\n## 1. FIRST: ANALYZE THE ZIP\n\nBefore coding:\n\n- Extract and inspect the entire project.\n- Understand its architecture, components, animations, styling, assets, dependencies, and existing functionality.\n- Identify reusable components and effects.\n- Preserve useful implementations instead of unnecessarily rewriting everything.\n- Remove birthday-specific content, panda celebrations, birthday cake logic, and irrelevant assets.\n- Maintain compatibility with the existing dependencies wherever practical.\n\nDo not just create a new landing page. Transform the complete experience.\n\n## 2. DESIGN DIRECTION\n\nProject name: Our First Chapter\n\nDedicated to: Rabeya \342\235\244\357\270\217\n\nVisual identity:\n- Premium romantic editorial aesthetic.\n- Blush pink, rose, warm ivory, champagne gold.\n- Soft gradients, subtle grain textures, glowing particles.\n- Elegant handwritten letter presentation.\n- Beautiful typography and carefully balanced whitespace.\n- Playfair Display for English headings.\n- Hind Siliguri or Noto Serif Bengali for Bengali text.\n\nThe website must look professionally designed, not like a generic AI-generated template.\n\n## 3. STORYTELLING EXPERIENCE\n\nBuild the experience as a sequence of cinematic scenes.\n\n### SCENE 1: THE WELCOME\n\nA beautiful, minimal opening screen.\n\nDisplay:\n\"Someone has a special message for you...\"\n\nShow a floating, animated sealed envelope with a glowing heart.\n\nButton: \"Open Your Surprise \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nOn click:\n- Play an envelope-opening animation.\n- Reveal the next scene with a smooth cinematic transition.\n- Introduce subtle floating hearts and particles.\n\n### SCENE 2: THE LOVE LETTER\n\nCreate a beautiful vintage-inspired digital letter.\n\nUse an elegant paper texture, soft shadows, decorative flowers, and handwritten-style details.\n\nHeading:\n\"\340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\277\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\246\276 \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nSubtitle:\n\"\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\245\340\246\256 \340\246\254\340\246\233\340\246\260\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\227\340\246\262\340\247\215\340\246\252\"\n\nDisplay the following message accurately in Bengali Unicode:\n\n\"\340\246\266\340\247\201\340\246\255 \340\247\247\340\246\256 \340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\267\340\246\277\340\246\225\340\247\200, \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\246\276! \342\235\244\357\270\217\360\237\216\211\n\n\340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260-\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\217\340\246\225\340\246\270\340\246\231\340\247\215\340\246\227\340\247\207 \340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\237\340\246\276\340\246\250\340\247\213 \340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\244\340\246\277\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\256\340\247\201\340\246\271\340\247\202\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\244 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\246\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\256\340\247\203\340\246\244\340\246\277\340\245\244 \340\246\225\340\247\200\340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\247\207 \340\246\217\340\246\225\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\254\340\246\233\340\246\260 \340\246\225\340\247\207\340\246\237\340\247\207 \340\246\227\340\247\207\340\246\262, \340\246\254\340\247\201\340\246\235\340\246\244\340\247\207\340\246\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\246\262\340\246\276\340\246\256 \340\246\250\340\246\276! \340\246\206\340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\245\340\246\276, \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\270\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\247\207 \340\246\205\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\225 \340\246\247\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\245\244 \340\246\244\340\247\201\340\246\256\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\211\340\246\252\340\246\271\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\245\244\n\n\340\246\206\340\246\266\340\246\276 \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\217\340\246\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\270\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\247\215\340\246\252\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\225 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\217\340\246\256\340\246\250\340\246\207\340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\217\340\246\227\340\246\277\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207, \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\260\340\246\276 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\226-\340\246\246\340\247\201\340\246\203\340\246\226\340\247\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\254\340\245\244 \340\246\206\340\246\227\340\246\276\340\246\256\340\247\200 \340\246\246\340\246\277\340\246\250\340\246\227\340\247\201\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\206\340\246\260\340\246\223 \340\246\205\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\225 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\246\340\246\260 \340\246\271\340\247\213\340\246\225! \360\237\222\226\n\n\340\246\206\340\246\262\340\247\215\340\246\262\340\246\276\340\246\271 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\247\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\226\340\247\201\340\246\225, \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\246\340\247\201\340\246\234\340\246\250\340\246\225\340\247\207\340\246\223 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\226\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\245\244\n\nHappy 1 Year, my love! \360\237\253\202\342\234\250\"\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Preserve the exact wording.\n- Do not invent additional relationship memories.\n- Use proper Bengali font rendering.\n- Animate the letter reveal elegantly, without making the user wait excessively.\n\n### SCENE 3: THREE PRECIOUS PHOTOGRAPHS\n\nUse the three REAL photographs supplied with this project.\n\nExpected assets:\n- public/images/rabeya-1.jpg\n- public/images/rabeya-2.jpg\n- public/images/rabeya-3.jpg\n\nIf filenames differ, inspect the ZIP and map the actual images correctly.\n\nDesign:\n- Three beautiful Polaroid-style photographs.\n- Slightly rotated frames with realistic shadows.\n- Smooth entrance animations.\n- Subtle parallax and hover effects.\n- Beautiful scrapbook-inspired composition.\n- Responsive mobile photo layout.\n\nDo not generate, replace, modify, or artificially reconstruct her face. Preserve the original photographs.\n\nDo not invent dates, locations, captions, or shared experiences.\n\n### SCENE 4: THE GRAND ANNIVERSARY REVEAL\n\nCreate a visually impressive celebration.\n\nMain centerpiece:\n\"1 YEAR\"\n\nSupporting text:\n\"365 days of love, memories & togetherness \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nEffects:\n- Animated glowing heart.\n- Floating rose petals.\n- Beautiful confetti burst.\n- Soft golden particles.\n- Cinematic background transitions.\n- Elegant animated anniversary typography.\n\nMake this moment emotionally impactful without overwhelming the screen.\n\n### SCENE 5: THE FINAL SURPRISE\n\nCreate a dreamy final scene with a romantic night-sky atmosphere.\n\nDisplay:\n\n\"This is only the first chapter of our story...\"\n\n\"Forever to go, my love. \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nInclude a final animated heart and a replay experience.\n\nProvide a way to replay the complete story from the beginning.\n\n## 4. MUSIC EXPERIENCE\n\nImplement a global background music controller.\n\nRequirements:\n- Romantic instrumental background music.\n- Play/pause functionality.\n- Volume control.\n- Persistent playback across scene transitions.\n- Elegant music indicator animation.\n- Respect browser autoplay restrictions.\n- Start music after the user\'s first interaction.\n\nIf no music file exists, create the audio integration with a configurable local asset path. Do not use an unauthorized copyrighted track.\n\n## 5. ANIMATION AND INTERACTION\n\nUse the existing animation library if suitable, otherwise use Motion.\n\nImplement:\n- Smooth scene transitions.\n- Envelope-opening animation.\n- Letter reveal animation.\n- Floating hearts and petals.\n- Polaroid entrance animations.\n- Scroll-triggered effects where appropriate.\n- Confetti celebration.\n- Subtle background movement.\n\nEvery interactive element must work.\n\nAvoid excessive animation, unnecessary loading screens, and performance-heavy effects.\n\n## 6. RESPONSIVE DESIGN\n\nMobile-first implementation is essential.\n\nTest the experience for:\n- Android smartphones.\n- iPhones.\n- Tablets.\n- Desktop browsers.\n\nRequirements:\n- No horizontal overflow.\n- Proper Bengali typography.\n- Images must maintain their aspect ratios.\n- Touch-friendly buttons.\n- Smooth performance on mid-range Android devices.\n- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.\n\n## 7. ENGINEERING REQUIREMENTS\n\n- Preserve the existing React + TypeScript + Vite architecture where practical.\n- Reuse useful existing components.\n- Keep components modular and maintainable.\n- Centralize anniversary content and asset paths in a configuration file.\n- Optimize image loading.\n- Avoid unnecessary dependencies.\n- Ensure audio cleanup and animation lifecycle management.\n- No console errors.\n- No broken interactions.\n- No placeholder content.\n- No fake functionality.\n\n## 8. FINAL VALIDATION\n\nBefore finishing:\n\n1. Run the existing project.\n2. Test every scene and transition.\n3. Verify all three photographs load.\n4. Verify Bengali text rendering.\n5. Test background music controls.\n6. Test mobile responsiveness.\n7. Run npm run build.\n8. Fix all TypeScript and build errors.\n\n## FINAL EXPECTATION\n\nDeliver a complete, working, polished anniversary website, not merely a design concept or prototype.\n\nThe experience should feel personal, cinematic, emotional, elegant, and memorable.\n\nPrioritize emotional storytelling and visual quality over unnecessary technical complexity.\n\nFirst analyze the provided ZIP, then implement the complete transformation."
    items {
      text: "# PROJECT: OUR FIRST CHAPTER \342\235\244\357\270\217\n## Premium Interactive 1st Anniversary Website\n\nAct as a senior frontend engineer, creative director, UI/UX designer, and motion designer.\n\nI am providing you with a ZIP file containing one of my previously developed React birthday storytelling websites. Your task is to transform it into a completely new, premium, romantic **1st Relationship Anniversary Experience** dedicated to a girl named Rabeya.\n\nThis is not a simple greeting website. It should feel like an interactive digital love story.\n\n## 1. FIRST: ANALYZE THE ZIP\n\nBefore coding:\n\n- Extract and inspect the entire project.\n- Understand its architecture, components, animations, styling, assets, dependencies, and existing functionality.\n- Identify reusable components and effects.\n- Preserve useful implementations instead of unnecessarily rewriting everything.\n- Remove birthday-specific content, panda celebrations, birthday cake logic, and irrelevant assets.\n- Maintain compatibility with the existing dependencies wherever practical.\n\nDo not just create a new landing page. Transform the complete experience.\n\n## 2. DESIGN DIRECTION\n\nProject name: Our First Chapter\n\nDedicated to: Rabeya \342\235\244\357\270\217\n\nVisual identity:\n- Premium romantic editorial aesthetic.\n- Blush pink, rose, warm ivory, champagne gold.\n- Soft gradients, subtle grain textures, glowing particles.\n- Elegant handwritten letter presentation.\n- Beautiful typography and carefully balanced whitespace.\n- Playfair Display for English headings.\n- Hind Siliguri or Noto Serif Bengali for Bengali text.\n\nThe website must look professionally designed, not like a generic AI-generated template.\n\n## 3. STORYTELLING EXPERIENCE\n\nBuild the experience as a sequence of cinematic scenes.\n\n### SCENE 1: THE WELCOME\n\nA beautiful, minimal opening screen.\n\nDisplay:\n\"Someone has a special message for you...\"\n\nShow a floating, animated sealed envelope with a glowing heart.\n\nButton: \"Open Your Surprise \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nOn click:\n- Play an envelope-opening animation.\n- Reveal the next scene with a smooth cinematic transition.\n- Introduce subtle floating hearts and particles.\n\n### SCENE 2: THE LOVE LETTER\n\nCreate a beautiful vintage-inspired digital letter.\n\nUse an elegant paper texture, soft shadows, decorative flowers, and handwritten-style details.\n\nHeading:\n\"\340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\277\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\246\276 \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nSubtitle:\n\"\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\245\340\246\256 \340\246\254\340\246\233\340\246\260\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\227\340\246\262\340\247\215\340\246\252\"\n\nDisplay the following message accurately in Bengali Unicode:\n\n\"\340\246\266\340\247\201\340\246\255 \340\247\247\340\246\256 \340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\267\340\246\277\340\246\225\340\247\200, \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\246\276! \342\235\244\357\270\217\360\237\216\211\n\n\340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260-\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\217\340\246\225\340\246\270\340\246\231\340\247\215\340\246\227\340\247\207 \340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\237\340\246\276\340\246\250\340\247\213 \340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\244\340\246\277\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\256\340\247\201\340\246\271\340\247\202\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\244 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\246\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\256\340\247\203\340\246\244\340\246\277\340\245\244 \340\246\225\340\247\200\340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\247\207 \340\246\217\340\246\225\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\254\340\246\233\340\246\260 \340\246\225\340\247\207\340\246\237\340\247\207 \340\246\227\340\247\207\340\246\262, \340\246\254\340\247\201\340\246\235\340\246\244\340\247\207\340\246\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\246\262\340\246\276\340\246\256 \340\246\250\340\246\276! \340\246\206\340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\245\340\246\276, \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\270\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\247\207 \340\246\205\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\225 \340\246\247\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\245\244 \340\246\244\340\247\201\340\246\256\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\211\340\246\252\340\246\271\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\245\244\n\n\340\246\206\340\246\266\340\246\276 \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\217\340\246\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\270\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\247\215\340\246\252\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\225 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\217\340\246\256\340\246\250\340\246\207\340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\217\340\246\227\340\246\277\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207, \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\260\340\246\276 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\226-\340\246\246\340\247\201\340\246\203\340\246\226\340\247\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\254\340\245\244 \340\246\206\340\246\227\340\246\276\340\246\256\340\247\200 \340\246\246\340\246\277\340\246\250\340\246\227\340\247\201\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\206\340\246\260\340\246\223 \340\246\205\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\225 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\246\340\246\260 \340\246\271\340\247\213\340\246\225! \360\237\222\226\n\n\340\246\206\340\246\262\340\247\215\340\246\262\340\246\276\340\246\271 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\247\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\226\340\247\201\340\246\225, \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\246\340\247\201\340\246\234\340\246\250\340\246\225\340\247\207\340\246\223 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\226\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\245\244\n\nHappy 1 Year, my love! \360\237\253\202\342\234\250\"\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Preserve the exact wording.\n- Do not invent additional relationship memories.\n- Use proper Bengali font rendering.\n- Animate the letter reveal elegantly, without making the user wait excessively.\n\n### SCENE 3: THREE PRECIOUS PHOTOGRAPHS\n\nUse the three REAL photographs supplied with this project.\n\nExpected assets:\n- public/images/rabeya-1.jpg\n- public/images/rabeya-2.jpg\n- public/images/rabeya-3.jpg\n\nIf filenames differ, inspect the ZIP and map the actual images correctly.\n\nDesign:\n- Three beautiful Polaroid-style photographs.\n- Slightly rotated frames with realistic shadows.\n- Smooth entrance animations.\n- Subtle parallax and hover effects.\n- Beautiful scrapbook-inspired composition.\n- Responsive mobile photo layout.\n\nDo not generate, replace, modify, or artificially reconstruct her face. Preserve the original photographs.\n\nDo not invent dates, locations, captions, or shared experiences.\n\n### SCENE 4: THE GRAND ANNIVERSARY REVEAL\n\nCreate a visually impressive celebration.\n\nMain centerpiece:\n\"1 YEAR\"\n\nSupporting text:\n\"365 days of love, memories & togetherness \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nEffects:\n- Animated glowing heart.\n- Floating rose petals.\n- Beautiful confetti burst.\n- Soft golden particles.\n- Cinematic background transitions.\n- Elegant animated anniversary typography.\n\nMake this moment emotionally impactful without overwhelming the screen.\n\n### SCENE 5: THE FINAL SURPRISE\n\nCreate a dreamy final scene with a romantic night-sky atmosphere.\n\nDisplay:\n\n\"This is only the first chapter of our story...\"\n\n\"Forever to go, my love. \342\235\244\357\270\217\"\n\nInclude a final animated heart and a replay experience.\n\nProvide a way to replay the complete story from the beginning.\n\n## 4. MUSIC EXPERIENCE\n\nImplement a global background music controller.\n\nRequirements:\n- Romantic instrumental background music.\n- Play/pause functionality.\n- Volume control.\n- Persistent playback across scene transitions.\n- Elegant music indicator animation.\n- Respect browser autoplay restrictions.\n- Start music after the user\'s first interaction.\n\nIf no music file exists, create the audio integration with a configurable local asset path. Do not use an unauthorized copyrighted track.\n\n## 5. ANIMATION AND INTERACTION\n\nUse the existing animation library if suitable, otherwise use Motion.\n\nImplement:\n- Smooth scene transitions.\n- Envelope-opening animation.\n- Letter reveal animation.\n- Floating hearts and petals.\n- Polaroid entrance animations.\n- Scroll-triggered effects where appropriate.\n- Confetti celebration.\n- Subtle background movement.\n\nEvery interactive element must work.\n\nAvoid excessive animation, unnecessary loading screens, and performance-heavy effects.\n\n## 6. RESPONSIVE DESIGN\n\nMobile-first implementation is essential.\n\nTest the experience for:\n- Android smartphones.\n- iPhones.\n- Tablets.\n- Desktop browsers.\n\nRequirements:\n- No horizontal overflow.\n- Proper Bengali typography.\n- Images must maintain their aspect ratios.\n- Touch-friendly buttons.\n- Smooth performance on mid-range Android devices.\n- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.\n\n## 7. ENGINEERING REQUIREMENTS\n\n- Preserve the existing React + TypeScript + Vite architecture where practical.\n- Reuse useful existing components.\n- Keep components modular and maintainable.\n- Centralize anniversary content and asset paths in a configuration file.\n- Optimize image loading.\n- Avoid unnecessary dependencies.\n- Ensure audio cleanup and animation lifecycle management.\n- No console errors.\n- No broken interactions.\n- No placeholder content.\n- No fake functionality.\n\n## 8. FINAL VALIDATION\n\nBefore finishing:\n\n1. Run the existing project.\n2. Test every scene and transition.\n3. Verify all three photographs load.\n4. Verify Bengali text rendering.\n5. Test background music controls.\n6. Test mobile responsiveness.\n7. Run npm run build.\n8. Fix all TypeScript and build errors.\n\n## FINAL EXPECTATION\n\nDeliver a complete, working, polished anniversary website, not merely a design concept or prototype.\n\nThe experience should feel personal, cinematic, emotional, elegant, and memorable.\n\nPrioritize emotional storytelling and visual quality over unnecessary technical complexity.\n\nFirst analyze the provided ZIP, then implement the complete transformation."
