  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Audio Controls**\n\nI\'ve decided to leave `AudioControls` as it is for the moment, because it\'s already quite clean. My current focus is on adding a volume slider, which will appear as a popup or dropdown when the volume button is clicked. Moreover, I plan to sync up the story chapter names with the five anniversary scenes, specifically: `WELCOME` (\"01 - The Surprise\"), `LOVE_LETTER` (\"02 - The Love Letter\"), and `PHOTOGRAPHS`.\n\n\n"
