  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Scene Requirements**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on Scene 3\'s specifications. The user\'s directive is clear: incorporate three specific, pre-supplied photographs. I\'m noting the expected file paths, which will guide my asset integration plan. The emphasis on utilizing these *real* assets is key. I\'ll need to prioritize how best to weave them into the narrative flow of this scene.\n\n\n**Refining Photo Implementation**\n\nI\'m now detailing the aesthetic implementation for the scene. I\'m focusing on the Polaroid-style presentation, with careful attention to drop shadows and authentic framing elements like washi tape or copper pins. I\'m defining rotation angles and exploring how to arrange these within a scrapbook-inspired composition. I\'m developing a responsive layout strategy for both desktop and mobile devices. Ensuring the user can tap and swipe the photographs is also a priority.\n\n\n"
