  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Component Architecture**\n\nI\'ve got the initial component setup with `Envelope.tsx`, `LetterCard.tsx`, and `MobileRomanticLetter.tsx`. Now, I\'m focusing on the five required scenes, aiming for meticulous design and emotional precision for Rabeya\'s 1st Anniversary.\n\n\n**Crafting Initial Scene Setup**\n\nI\'m laying the groundwork for the anniversary experience, currently titled \"**OUR FIRST CHAPTER \342\235\244\357\270\217**,\" specifically for Rabeya\'s 1st Anniversary. I\'m focusing on \"SCENE 1: THE WELCOME,\" starting with `WelcomeScene.tsx`, which will feature an animated envelope with a glowing heart. The interaction will involve a button labeled \"Open Your Surprise \342\235\244\357\270\217,\" triggering an opening animation and transition to Scene 2 with music playback and floating hearts.\n\n\n**Expressing Sentiment Deeply**\n\nI\'m reflecting deeply on our shared year. Each moment feels precious and beautiful, I can\'t believe it\'s been a year already! I feel immense gratitude for the trust, love, and constant support. I hope our bond continues to thrive and we stand by each other through all of life\'s experiences. May the coming days be filled with even more joy and blessings for both of us.\n\n\n**Designing Photo Memories Scene**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in Scene 3, \"THREE PRECIOUS PHOTOGRAPHS,\" implementing the Polaroid-style photo display using the provided images. I\'m focusing on the aesthetic details, crafting realistic paper frames with drop shadows, and angled compositions. I am considering appropriate animations and responsive design elements. I will use a lightbox modal for high-res viewing with zero obstruction. The continue button will read \"Celebrate.\"\n\n\n**Developing Final Scene Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing Scenes 4 and 5. For Scene 4, \"THE GRAND ANNIVERSARY REVEAL\", I\'m working with opulent gold typography and animated effects: glowing hearts, rose petals, and confetti. Scene 5, \"THE FINAL SURPRISE,\" will have a dreamy night sky with final heartfelt messages and a replay button to restart the experience. I\'m focusing on the overall flow and emotional impact.\n\n\n**Implementing Music Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating an all-encompassing background music controller, `AudioControls.tsx`, with a focus on seamless transitions across all scenes. I\'m focusing on a romantic acoustic music box arpeggio synthesizer, with the option for custom tracks. I\'ve included play/pause functionality, volume control with slider and mute toggle, and an elegant animated music bar indicator. Autoplay will be triggered by the user\'s initial click or tap. Finally, I\'ve created `src/types/anniversary.ts`, containing `AnniversarySceneId` and `AnniversaryConfig` to keep things typed and clean.\n\n\n**Translating Key Anniversary Text**\n\nI\'m now integrating Bengali text. I\'ve translated the provided paragraphs, aiming for emotional resonance and cultural accuracy. I\'m focusing on preserving the original sentiment of the anniversary message while ensuring it flows seamlessly within the app\'s design. I\'m ensuring all the assets are correctly mapped with the text.\n\n\n**Expressing Deep Affection**\n\nI\'m now integrating loving Bengali text, reflecting on our first year together. \"\340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\247\207 \340\246\205\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\225 \340\246\247\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\245\244 \340\246\244\340\247\201\340\246\256\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\211\340\246\252\340\246\271\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\245\244\" is a key message, expressing gratitude for your presence in my life, calling you the best gift. I hope our bond continues to thrive. I\'m ensuring everything feels accurate within the app and the sentiment is well-conveyed.\n\n\n"
