  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Initial Configuration**\n\nI\'m now structuring the project\'s foundational configuration. I\'ve begun creating `src/config/anniversary.ts` and am focusing on extracting the core elements from the initial user request, specifically the project name \"Our First Chapter\" and the dedication \"Rabeya \342\235\244\357\270\217.\"  I\'m also setting up the first scene, including the introductory message and the \"Open Your Surprise \342\235\244\357\270\217\" button.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Bengali Text**\n\nI\'m now diving into the Bengali text. I\'m focusing on parsing the meaning of each sentence and identifying the key emotional beats for translation. I will ensure the essence of the message, including the celebration of the first anniversary, the gratitude for Rabeya, the expression of love, and the hope for the future, are accurately captured. I want to convey it in a way that respects the original tone and sentiment.\n\n\n**Constructing the Scenes**\n\nI\'m now building Scenes 3, 4, and 5. For Scene 3, I\'m integrating the three provided photographs with fallback options. I\'m avoiding invented data as instructed. In Scene 4, I\'ve designed the centerpiece \"1 YEAR\" with supporting text reflecting the anniversary. Scene 5 will feature the \"first chapter\" text and a replay option. I\'m also ensuring the audio integrates correctly with both provided and fallback options.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
