    thinking: "**Defining Scene Management**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing scene management for the anniversary event. My latest action involves updating `useSceneManager.ts` to handle five distinct scenes: WELCOME, LOVE_LETTER, PHOTOGRAPHS, ANNIVERSARY_REVEAL, and FINAL_SURPRISE. I\'m exploring the `src/hooks/useSceneManager.ts` file to guide the writing with `AnniversarySceneId`.\n\n\n"
