    thinking: "**Crafting Scene Two**\n\nI\'m now diving into the development of `LoveLetterScene.tsx`. My current focus is on creating a vintage-style digital letter. I am aiming to incorporate the specified design elements \342\200\223 an elegant paper texture, soft shadows, floral decorations, and handwritten-style details. The heading will be \'\340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\277\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\246\276 \342\235\244\357\270\217\', with the subtitle as \'\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\245\340\246\256 \340\246\254\340\246\233\340\246\260\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\227\340\246\262\340\247\215\340\246\252\'.\n\n\n**Translating the Message**\n\nI have accurately translated the message to Bengali Unicode. It reads: \'\340\246\266\340\247\201\340\246\255 \340\247\247\340\246\256 \340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\267\340\246\277\340\246\225\340\247\200, \340\246\260\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\246\276! \342\235\244\357\270\217\360\237\216\211 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260-\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\217\340\246\225\340\246\270\340\246\231\340\247\215\340\246\227\340\247\207 \340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\237\340\246\276\340\246\250\340\247\213 \340\246\252\340\247\215\340\246\260\340\246\244\340\246\277\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\256\340\247\201\340\246\271\340\247\202\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\244 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\246\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\256\340\247\203\340\246\244\340\246\277\340\245\244 \340\246\225\340\247\200\340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\247\207 \340\246\217\340\246\225\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\254\340\246\233\340\246\260 \340\246\225\340\247\207\340\246\237\340\247\207 \340\246\227\340\247\207\340\246\262, \340\246\254\340\247\201\340\246\235\340\246\244\340\247\207\340\246\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\246\262\340\246\276\340\246\256 \340\246\250\340\246\276! \340\246\206\340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\245\340\246\276, \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\270\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257 \340\246\244\340\247\213\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\247\207 \340\246\205\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\225 \340\246\247\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\257\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\245\244 \340\246\244\340\247\201\340\246\256\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\234\340\247\200\340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\246\254\340\246\232\340\247\207\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\211\340\246\252\340\246\271\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\245\244 \340\246\206\340\246\266\340\246\276 \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\246\277 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\246\217\340\246\207 \340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\247\213\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\270\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\247\215\340\246\252\340\246\260\340\247\215\340\246\225 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\246\256\340\246\257\340\246\274 \340\246\217\340\246\256\340\246\250\340\246\207\340\246\255\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\217\340\246\227\340\246\277\340\246\257\340\246\274\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\246\276\340\246\254\340\247\207, \340\246\217\340\246\254\340\246\202 \340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\260\340\246\276 \340\246\270\340\246\254 \340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\226-\340\246\246\340\247\201\340\246\203\340\246\226\340\247\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\266\340\247\207 \340\246\245\340\246\276\340\246\225\340\246\254\340\245\244 \340\246\206\340\246\227\340\246\276\340\246\256\340\247\200 \340\246\246\340\246\277\340\246\250\340\246\227\340\247\201\340\246\262\340\247\213 \340\246\206\340\246\260\340\246\223\'\n\n\n**Designing the UI**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Bengali script with appropriate fonts, ensuring ideal spacing. My focus is the parchment paper design with soft golden filigree, cream texture, rose watermark, delicate border, and floral flourishes, using `#fdfaf3`. I will also implement elegant, staggered animation for paragraphs and a continue button for the next scene. The button will say \"\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\247\251\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\256\340\246\247\340\247\201\340\246\260 \340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\256\340\247\203\340\246\244\340\246\277 \340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\226\340\247\201\340\246\250 \342\234\250\" with a romantic hover effect.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9145649814314905265"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { motion } from \'motion/react\';\\nimport { Heart, Sparkles, ArrowRight } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { ANNIVERSARY_CONFIG } from \'../config/anniversary\';\\n\\ninterface LoveLetterSceneProps {\\n  onContinue: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const LoveLetterScene: React.FC<LoveLetterSceneProps> = ({ onContinue }) => {\\n  const { letter, recipientName } = ANNIVERSARY_CONFIG;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"relative flex min-h-[100dvh] w-full flex-col items-center justify-between px-3 sm:px-6 py-6 sm:py-10 select-none overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n      {/* Top Breadcrumb Kicker */}\\n      <motion.div\\n        initial={{ opacity: 0, y: -10 }}\\n        animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n        transition={{ duration: 0.6 }}\\n        className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs md:text-sm font-sans tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#e5a4b4]/85\\\"\\n      >\\n        <span>Chapter I</span>\\n        <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" className=\\\"text-[#dfb285]\\\">\302\267</span>\\n        <span>The Love Letter</span>\\n      </motion.div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Vintage Parchment Letter Container */}\\n      <div className=\\\"my-auto w-full max-w-2xl py-4 flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n        <motion.div\\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 25, scale: 0.97 }}\\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n          className=\\\"relative w-full rounded-3xl bg-[#faf5ee] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 text-[#2c131f] shadow-[0_25px_60px_rgba(20,5,15,0.55),0_0_0_1px_rgba(235,190,195,0.5)] border border-[#ebd5cc]\\\"\\n          style={{\\n            backgroundImage: `radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(247, 219, 224, 0.35) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(250, 230, 210, 0.35) 0%, transparent 60%), linear-gradient(to bottom, #fdfaf4, #f8f1e7)`,\\n          }}\\n        >\\n          {/* Decorative Vintage Golden Corners */}\\n          <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute top-4 left-4 h-7 w-7 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-[#dfb285] rounded-tl-xl\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute top-4 right-4 h-7 w-7 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-[#dfb285] rounded-tr-xl\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute bottom-4 left-4 h-7 w-7 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-[#dfb285] rounded-bl-xl\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute bottom-4 right-4 h-7 w-7 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-[#dfb285] rounded-br-xl\\\" />\\n\\n          {/* Letter Inner Dashed Parchment Border */}\\n          <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-3 sm:inset-4 border border-dashed border-[#d8b79a]/40 rounded-2xl\\\" />\\n\\n          {/* Letter Content */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative z-10 space-y-6\\\">\\n            {/* Header: Heading & Subtitle */}\\n            <div className=\\\"text-center pb-3 border-b border-[#ebd0be]/70\\\">\\n              <motion.div\\n                initial={{ scale: 0.8, opacity: 0 }}\\n                animate={{ scale: 1, opacity: 1 }}\\n                transition={{ delay: 0.2, duration: 0.5 }}\\n                className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center mb-2\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#fcedf1] text-[#9b2c4c] border border-[#e8a2b5]/40 shadow-sm\\\">\\n                  <Heart className=\\\"h-5 w-5 fill-[#9b2c4c]\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n              </motion.div>\\n\\n              <motion.h2\\n                initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }}\\n                animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n                transition={{ delay: 0.3, duration: 0.6 }}\\n                className=\\\"font-bengali text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#591b2c]\\\"\\n                style={{ fontFamily: \'\\\"Noto Serif Bengali\\\", \\\"Hind Siliguri\\\", serif\' }}\\n              >\\n                {letter.heading}\\n              </motion.h2>\\n\\n              <motion.p\\n                initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\\n                animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\\n                transition={{ delay: 0.4, duration: 0.6 }}\\n                className=\\\"mt-1 font-bengali text-sm sm:text-base font-medium text-[#8f495c] tracking-wide\\\"\\n                style={{ fontFamily: \'\\\"Noto Serif Bengali\\\", \\\"Hind Siliguri\\\", serif\' }}\\n              >\\n                {letter.subtitle}\\n              </motion.p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Scrollable Letter Body in Accurate Bengali */}\\n            <div className=\\\"custom-scrollbar max-h-[52vh] sm:max-h-[56vh] overflow-y-auto pr-2 sm:pr-4 space-y-4 text-left\\\">\\n              {letter.paragraphs.map((para, idx) => (\\n                <motion.p\\n                  key={idx}\\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 12 }}\\n                  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n                  transition={{ delay: 0.45 + idx * 0.12, duration: 0.6 }}\\n                  className={`font-bengali leading-relaxed text-[#351624] ${\\n                    idx === 0\\n                      ? \'text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#782038] pb-1\'\\n                      : idx === letter.paragraphs.length - 1\\n                      ? \'text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#82223c] pt-2\'\\n                      : \'text-sm sm:text-base font-normal text-[#381a28]/95\'\\n                  }`}\\n                  style={{\\n                    fontFamily: \'\\\"Noto Serif Bengali\\\", \\\"Hind Siliguri\\\", serif\',\\n                    lineHeight: \'1.85\',\\n                  }}\\n                >\\n                  {para}\\n                </motion.p>\\n              ))}\\n\\n              {/* Sign-Off & Signature */}\\n              <motion.div\\n                initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\\n                animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\\n                transition={{ delay: 0.45 + letter.paragraphs.length * 0.12 + 0.15 }}\\n                className=\\\"pt-4 border-t border-[#ebd0be]/70 text-right space-y-1\\\"\\n              >\\n                <p\\n                  className=\\\"font-bengali text-sm sm:text-base italic text-[#6e2739]\\\"\\n                  style={{ fontFamily: \'\\\"Noto Serif Bengali\\\", \\\"Hind Siliguri\\\", serif\' }}\\n                >\\n                  {letter.signOff}\\n                </p>\\n                <p\\n                  className=\\\"font-bengali text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#862540]\\\"\\n                  style={{ fontFamily: \'\\\"Noto Serif Bengali\\\", \\\"Hind Siliguri\\\", serif\' }}\\n                >\\n                  {letter.signature}\\n                </p>\\n              </motion.div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Continue Button */}\\n            <motion.div\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 15 }}\\n              animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              transition={{ delay: 0.9, duration: 0.6 }}\\n              className=\\\"pt-4 flex justify-center border-t border-[#ebd0be]/60\\\"\\n            >\\n              <button\\n                onClick={onContinue}\\n                className=\\\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 sm:px-10 py-3.5 sm:py-4 min-h-[52px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#862540] via-[#ab3958] to-[#741c33] text-[#fff6f4] font-sans text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-wide shadow-[0_6px_22px_rgba(134,37,64,0.45)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(134,37,64,0.65)] hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation border border-[#f5c7d2]/40 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#dfb285]\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\260 \340\247\251\340\246\237\340\246\277 \340\246\270\340\247\215\340\246\256\340\247\203\340\246\244\340\246\277 \340\246\246\340\247\207\340\246\226\340\247\201\340\246\250</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[#ffd1dc] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\\\">\\n                  <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                </span>\\n              </button>\\n            </motion.div>\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Decorative Bottom Note */}\\n      <motion.div\\n        initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\\n        animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\\n        transition={{ delay: 0.8 }}\\n        className=\\\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-sans text-[#e5a4b4]/75 tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n      >\\n        <Sparkles className=\\\"h-3 w-3 text-[#dfb285]\\\" />\\n        <span>Dedicated to {recipientName} \302\267 365 Days of Togetherness</span>\\n        <Sparkles className=\\\"h-3 w-3 text-[#dfb285]\\\" />\\n      </motion.div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Scene 2: The Love Letter - vintage-inspired letter with accurate Bengali Unicode text and elegant parchment styling\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/scenes/LoveLetterScene.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating LoveLetterScene\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/scenes/LoveLetterScene.tsx\"}"
